Id: root001w
Severity: WARN
Category: accounts
Check: check_root
Fix: Remove the pseudo-terminal entries from /etc/securetty (CONSOLE=/dev/console in default/login).
References: securetty(5)
Controls: CIS 5.4; NIST AC-6, AC-17; ISO 8.2, 8.5; CE User access control

The indicated file allows remote (i.e., other than system console).
root logins for telnet and other services.  For /etc/default/login,
be sure that the line "CONSOLE=/dev/console" exists.  For /etc/securetty,
be sure that there are no ttyp entries.
